<mxfile host="qc_native_preference_tuning"><diagram name="language_medium_design" id="language_medium_design"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="1000"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Experiment matrix, series S01.&lt;/b&gt; Rows: what the evaluated model was finetuned on. Columns: language of the evaluation items. Every cell uses the same source items translated per language, the same pinned finetuning recipe and a language-agnostic scorer. Tier 0 rows are the minimum publishable unit; tier 1 repeats native and english_anchor on a size-matched contrast base model (gsm8k only); tier 2 adds the pooled and Indonesian-anchor arms." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="1000" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="finetune condition \ eval language" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="120" width="270" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="en" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="120" width="120" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="id" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="120" width="120" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="jv" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="120" width="120" height="58" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="su" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeCo